at":"2021-01-20T18:36:15Z","body":"I was able to compile curl ngtcp2 version with OpenSSL on Linux desktop and re-run performance test again. \r\n\r\nResults are the same as quiche version on mac OS yesterday:\r\n\r\n**Curl build info**\r\n```\r\n./curl -V\r\ncurl 7.75.0-DEV (x86_64-pc-linux-gnu) libcurl/7.75.0-DEV OpenSSL/1.1.1g zlib/1.2.11 libidn2/2.2.0 ngtcp2/0.1.0-DEV nghttp3/0.1.0-DEV\r\nRelease-Date: [unreleased]\r\nProtocols: dict file ftp ftps gopher gophers http https imap imaps mqtt pop3 pop3s rtsp smb smbs smtp smtps telnet tftp \r\nFeatures: alt-svc AsynchDNS HTTP3 HTTPS-proxy IDN IPv6 Largefile libz NTLM NTLM_WB SSL TLS-SRP UnixSockets\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\n**HTTP/3**\r\n ```\r\n% ./curl -o http3.iso --http3 \"https://xxx.xxx/debian-10.7.0-amd64-DVD-1.iso\"\r\n  % Total    % Received % Xferd  Average Speed   Time    Time     Time  Current\r\n                                 Dload  Upload   Total   Spent    Left  Speed\r\n  0 3788M    0 8371k    0     0  1651k      0  0:39:09  0:00:05  0:39:04 1674k\r\n```\r\n\r\n**HTTP/2**\r\n\r\n```\r\n./curl -o http2.iso \"https://xxx.xxx/debian-10.7.0-amd64-DVD-1.iso\" \r\n  % Total    % Received % Xferd  Average Speed   Time    Time     Time  Current\r\n                                 Dload  Upload   Total   Spent    Left  Speed\r\n  1 3788M    1 70.5M    0     0  17.2M      0  0:03:39  0:00:04  0:03:35 17.2M\r\n```\r\n\r\nPlease advice on how to proceed with finding where time is spent (curl options, tracing etc.)?","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/curl/curl/issues/comments/763610644/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"peak-load","id":34206325,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0MjA2MzI1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34206325?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/peak-load","html_url":"https://github.com/p